darwincore
larvae
wrangling

# data/parquet/ is now HALF of an ingest's output, not all of it.
#
# The bulk parquet moved out of the working tree entirely — it stages under
# $CALCOFI_STAGE_DIR (calcofi4db::cc_stage_dir(), default ~/_big/calcofi) on its
# way to gs://calcofi-db/. What stays here is the reviewable half: each ingest's
# manifest.json, metadata.json and relationships.json — kilobytes, diffable, and
# the schema/provenance record the release reads. Those are TRACKED.
#
# The old rule was a blanket `parquet`, which was the only practical option when
# 24 GB of bytes shared the directory — and it swept the sidecars out of version
# control as collateral. Nothing under data/parquet/ was tracked at all.
#
# Keep the .parquet guard anyway: a run with CALCOFI_STAGE_DIR misconfigured, or
# an older notebook, would otherwise drop gigabytes here one `git add -A` from
# history.
parquet/**/*.parquet
# _old/ is a 21 GB stale snapshot predating the split; not part of the pipeline.
parquet/_old/
# `wrangling` above catches data/wrangling/*.duckdb, but ingest_spatial.qmd used
# to drop a 27 MB scratch DB at THIS level, where that rule cannot see it. The
# step is gone (nothing ever read the file — the release builds `_spatial` from
# the parquet shard); this keeps a stale copy, or a re-added one, out of git.
calcofi_wrangling.duckdb
# PMTiles are a BUILD ARTIFACT here. ingest_spatial.qmd uploads them to
# gs://calcofi-files-public/_spatial/, which is where db-viz-hex reads them from
# — nothing resolves them out of a clone. 34 MB across 17 files, every one
# rewritten in full on each run.
pmtiles/
# generated download cache and erddap dataset outputs (synced via rclone, not git)
cache
erddap
# bulk Access extraction (tables/*.parquet); the reviewable half of the extract is
# committed under metadata/calcofi/hydro-master/accdb/
accdb

# Frozen releases. Unlike every sibling above, this one CANNOT be ignored
# wholesale: the small sidecars beside the data (catalog.json, metadata.json,
# relationships*.json/csv, RELEASE_NOTES.md, erd.mmd, test_results.json) are the
# provenance record and are deliberately tracked — 18 releases' worth of them.
# Only `parquet/` is bulk: 1.6-11 GB per release, 41 GB locally at the time of
# writing, and it lives on gs://calcofi-db/ducklake/releases/{version}/ which is
# what consumers actually read.
#
# It was never listed here, so nothing was ever committed by accident — but every
# release left a multi-GB directory sitting in `git status` as untracked, one
# `git add -A` away from entering history. Naming it is the guard.
releases/*/parquet/
